    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1349">

                <pb facs="0905" n="789" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg789"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/123.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Willard.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 16, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your January 14. Appropriate telegraphic instructions have been sent to Consuls
                    in Chihuahua. Other consular officers will be suitably instructed to facilitate
                    Mr. Cardenas’s missions at other points he may visit.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
